<title>DENMARK: Rieber seeks 67 pct in Phoenix.</title>
<headline>Rieber seeks 67 pct in Phoenix.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber and Son said on Monday that it would take over Danish roadmaker Phoenix Contractors if it succeeded in buying at least 66.66 percent of its shares.</p>
<p>In its original bid document Rieber had set a 90 percent minimum holding as a precondition for carrying out the acquisition.</p>
</text>
